0.01  Initial release
      - Connections: SQLite, MySQL/MariaDB, PostgreSQL (multiple, named, fork-safe)
      - Query builder, Moo based models, relations (has_one/has_many/belongs_to/belongs_to_many)
      - Eager loading, soft deletes, casts, accessors/mutators, hooks, scopes
      - Schema builder + file based migrations with batches, rollback, pretend
      - Mojolicious plugin with helpers and the `mimir` command
